    { zone = 236, name = 'Vana\'versary Moogle', label = '8th Vana\'versary (2010)', model = 82, pos = { 52.902, 8.499, -240.776 }, lines = {
        'Hey! I already gave you a present! You can\'t fool me, kupo!',
        'You can purchase your 8th Vana\'versary Mog Bonanza tickets here, kupo.',
        'Mog Bonanza is a number guessing game, kupo.',
        'You can check winning numbers and claim prizes for the 8th Vana\'versary Mog Bonanza here, kupo.',
        'If you have <ki>% for the 8th Vana\'versary Mog Bonanza, trade them to me one at a time.',
    } },
    { zone = 238, name = 'Vana\'versary Moogle', label = '8th Vana\'versary (2010)', model = 82, pos = { -53.660, -5.593, 217.909 }, lines = {
        'Happy Eighth Vana\'versary, adventurer!',
        'A host of congratulatory letters has been sent to me from all over Vana\'diel, kupo! I\'ll read them out to you this instant! Ahem!',
        'First we have a letter bearing the seal of His Royal Highness King Destin, kupo. Esteemed adventurers of Vana\'diel, Your valorous deeds have captured the hearts and minds of an entire kingdom.',
        'Time and again have you proven yourselves paragons of knightly excellence. Forever more shall your names live on in the annals of our nation.',
        'Destin R d\'Oraguille',
        'Next is a letter bearing the seal of His Excellency, President Karst, kupo. Dear and noble adventurers, Though our roads are yet rife with danger, progress has been made towards establishing a safe route of passage to Selbina.',
        'Though hostile creatures yet lurk in our mines, many are those who have salvaged life and limb thanks to your altruistic actions.',
        'It is in great part due to the incurably inquisitive nature of adventurers that the Republic of Bastok owes its prosperity. May all your future endeavors be met with success.',
    } },
    { zone = 240, name = 'Vana\'versary Moogle', label = '8th Vana\'versary (2010)', model = 82, pos = { 187.740, -11.999, 219.230 }, lines = {
        'You can purchase your 8th Vana\'versary Mog Bonanza tickets here, kupo.',
        'Mog Bonanza is a number guessing game, kupo.',
        'You can check winning numbers and claim prizes for the 8th Vana\'versary Mog Bonanza here, kupo.',
        'If you have <ki>% for the 8th Vana\'versary Mog Bonanza, trade them to me one at a time.',
    } },
    { zone = 246, name = 'Old Traveller', label = 'New Year 2007 (Windurst-Jeuno airship)', model = 82, pos = { -164.730, 11.000, 87.030 }, lines = {
        'Oh, Happy New Year, [sonny/missy]. I was just talking with one of my...um...grandchildren on this here fan-dangled <item><item>. Have you ever seen anything like it? Boy, the times, they are a-changing, yessiree! Why, back in my day, we had',
        'And so I decided to come up here and see if I couldn\'t paint it. Back before the war, I used to be a mighty-fine ar-tiste. Why, I once painted a picture for the Star Sybil herself!',
        'Hm? That piece you\'re packin\' looks kind of familiar-like. Is that <item><item>? Why, I remember back before the war, all the cool cats used to wear two of those, one on each hip. Yes sir, the ladies would swoon when those \'dores went a-swa',
    } },
    { zone = 100, name = 'Ranch Greeter', label = 'New Year 2009 (Buffalo Bonanza Ranch)', model = 82, pos = { -380.547, -35.841, 140.833 }, lines = {
        'On behalf of all the staff at the Buffalo Bonanza Ranch, I wish you a happy new year! You\'ll be pleased to know that we\'ve recently opened shop in Jeuno.',
        'To commemorate the opening of our new branch, we\'re giving away presents to all our valued customers.',
        'Uleguerand milk fresh from the ranch to you! You can\'t beat that smooth, creamy texture! Do try it!',
        'Our Uleguerand milk meets the strictest sanitation requirements in all nations known to self-respecting adventurers. Each thirst-quenching gulp is guaranteed to be free of germs and harmful parasites.',
        'Chock-full of nutrients, yet irresistible to all palates, no matter your race--that\'s the Uleguerand milk promise.',
        'You look like an adventurer who knows [his/her] milk. Compare ours with the common Selbina variety, and you\'ll surely taste--no, feel--the difference.',
        'Looking for a way to up your synthesis skill? Then have a jug or twelve of our Uleguerand milk!',
        'The Buffalo Bonanza Ranch\'s Jeuno representative is located at H-9 in the Ru\'lude Gardens. We look forward to your custom.',
        'A big happy new year from all the staff at the Buffalo Bonanza Ranch! Please visit our newly opened shop in Jeuno!',
        'We\'ve opened a new branch! Here\'s a little present for you, our valued customer.',
        'Won\'t you look at my magnificent physique? I owe it all the Buffalo Bonanza Ranch products I\'ve been eating since being weaned!',
        'Thanks to Uleguerand milk, I was able to find my soulmate!',
    } },
